\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs28 Image Converter \endash  quick guide\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b What it is for\b0\par
\pard\sa100\fi-360\li720\bullet\tab Batch-convert images in a folder among JPEG, PNG, BMP, GIF, WEBP, ICO, SVG, and PDF.\par
\bullet\tab Preview thumbnails, pick files, and convert without a separate export step.\par
\bullet\tab Useful for preparing web assets, icons, PDF snapshots, and format cleanup on Windows.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b Getting started\b0\par
\pard\sa100\fi-360\li720 1.\tab Choose an image folder (File \endash  Open folder, or Browse on the main window).\par
2.\tab Thumbnails load in the review list. Drag a folder or files onto the list to set the folder.\par
3.\tab Select one or more images.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b Converting\b0\par
\pard\sa100\fi-360\li720\bullet\tab Right-click a selected thumbnail \endash  Convert to \endash  pick a format.\par
\bullet\tab Convert to Icon creates or rebuilds .ico files using the ICO size and letterbox settings at the top.\par
\bullet\tab New files are saved in the same folder (same name, new extension) and selected after convert.\par
\bullet\tab If a file already exists, you are asked to confirm overwrite.\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b Other actions (right-click or File menu)\b0\par
\pard\sa100\fi-360\li720\bullet\tab Copy / Copy image path\par
\bullet\tab Rename (F2)\par
\bullet\tab Delete\par
\bullet\tab Open file location\par
\bullet\tab Open by Paint or Paint.NET\par
\bullet\tab Paste image from clipboard into the folder\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b Keyboard shortcuts\b0\par
\pard\sa100\fi-360\li720\bullet\tab F5 \endash  refresh review\par
\bullet\tab F2 \endash  rename selected file\par
\bullet\tab Ctrl+C \endash  copy path (when list is focused)\par
\bullet\tab Ctrl+V / Ctrl+P \endash  paste image\par
\bullet\tab Ctrl+Z \endash  undo last operation\par
\bullet\tab Delete \endash  delete selected files\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b Tips\b0\par
\pard\sa100\fi-360\li720\bullet\tab Use small / medium / large thumbnail size to fit more or fewer items on screen.\par
\bullet\tab Undo removes converted output files from the last successful batch.\par
\bullet\tab Cancel stops a conversion batch in progress.\par
}
